# Butler Routes - Arathi recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics, manuals and formulas whose SOURCE
# is physically in Arathi Highlands, verified against the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Fifteen recipes are
# vendor-sold around Refuge Pointe, the east and the keep; eight more drop
# exclusively (or near-exclusively) from Arathi mobs. Every other
# Arathi-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records
# carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught
# staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each
# step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Fishing
# has no Arathi source, so it is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/arathi-recipes
title Arathi Highlands - Recipes & Patterns
levels 30-40
zone Arathi Highlands
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords arathi, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking — Refuge Pointe (Keena)

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 2821 -- Keena (74.09, 32.73), Trade Goods
  buy 3682 "Recipe: Curiously Tasty Omelet"
  buy 12228 "Recipe: Roast Raptor"
  note Keena also sells the Barbaric Leggings pattern and the Lesser Deflection formula (other professions, other steps). Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Leatherworking — Refuge Pointe (Keena)

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 2821 -- Keena (74.09, 32.73), Trade Goods
  buy 5973 "Pattern: Barbaric Leggings"
  note Hammon Karwn in Refuge Pointe stocks this pattern as well. Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

